{"4351830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Domino Chillbox", "steam_appid": 4351830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hey everyone! This is actually my very first game. I wanted to create a sandbox-style domino game where you have total freedom to do whatever you want.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">I've put a lot of love into the physics system. It might not be 100% perfect, but honestly, I think it turned out pretty good! Also, just lining up regular dominoes and knocking them down felt a bit too basic to me. So, I threw in 3 or 4 special dominoes to spice things up, and I definitely plan to add even more in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Oh, and there’s also an <strong>image-to-domino feature!</strong> You just upload a picture, and it automatically converts it into a domino setup. You should definitely give it a try—I’d really love to hear what you guys think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">I really hope you all have fun with it and support my journey. See you in the next project!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Drag Placement:</strong> Seamlessly build your domino runs with an intuitive drag-and-place system. The game automatically calculates spacing and turning angles, or you can manually adjust the scale and rotation to create complex and unique structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-Packed Dominoes:</strong> Take your domino falls to the next level with 4 special types of dominoes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomb:</strong> Creates a massive explosion, blasting surrounding dominoes away in a satisfying shockwave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rocket:</strong> Launches forward, crashing through anything in its path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firework:</strong> Shoots into the sky and explodes into beautiful colors, sending physical shockwaves down to the ground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Firefly:</strong> Emits a glowing light, creating a breathtaking and magical atmosphere in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/5e6e364c2fc4bfd806b87e48f6325610.poster.avif?t=1775718234\" width=800 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/5e6e364c2fc4bfd806b87e48f6325610.webm?t=1775718234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/5e6e364c2fc4bfd806b87e48f6325610.mp4?t=1775718234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Image-to-Domino Art:</strong> A groundbreaking procedural feature! Simply upload your favorite images (.png, .jpg), and the game will automatically convert the colored pixels into stunning domino floor art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/dd1e4a22abc65a5a18c40e5313a96f10.poster.avif?t=1775718234\" width=800 height=588 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/dd1e4a22abc65a5a18c40e5313a96f10.webm?t=1775718234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/dd1e4a22abc65a5a18c40e5313a96f10.mp4?t=1775718234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environment:</strong> Take full control of the time of day with a dynamic time slider. Watch your colorful creations fall under different lighting conditions, from bright daylight to moody nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/1d774438ece8cd7c902bc4eb989d0107.poster.avif?t=1775718234\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/1d774438ece8cd7c902bc4eb989d0107.webm?t=1775718234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/1d774438ece8cd7c902bc4eb989d0107.mp4?t=1775718234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Save &amp; Load System:</strong> Building a massive project? No problem. Save your progress in up to 4 dedicated slots and return to complete your masterpiece whenever you're ready.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-Roaming Camera:</strong> Fly around your creations in full 360 degrees. Find the perfect angle and capture the most satisfying, cinematic shots of your domino runs falling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-Language Support:</strong> Play in your preferred language! The game UI fully supports English, Thai, Chinese, Japanese, and Spanish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/f36eb0030151dbd116b2e8454bc1c56e.poster.avif?t=1775718234\" width=800 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/f36eb0030151dbd116b2e8454bc1c56e.webm?t=1775718234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/f36eb0030151dbd116b2e8454bc1c56e.mp4?t=1775718234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hey everyone! This is actually my very first game. I wanted to create a sandbox-style domino game where you have total freedom to do whatever you want.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">I've put a lot of love into the physics system. It might not be 100% perfect, but honestly, I think it turned out pretty good! Also, just lining up regular dominoes and knocking them down felt a bit too basic to me. So, I threw in 3 or 4 special dominoes to spice things up, and I definitely plan to add even more in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Oh, and there’s also an <strong>image-to-domino feature!</strong> You just upload a picture, and it automatically converts it into a domino setup. You should definitely give it a try—I’d really love to hear what you guys think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">I really hope you all have fun with it and support my journey. See you in the next project!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Drag Placement:</strong> Seamlessly build your domino runs with an intuitive drag-and-place system. The game automatically calculates spacing and turning angles, or you can manually adjust the scale and rotation to create complex and unique structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-Packed Dominoes:</strong> Take your domino falls to the next level with 4 special types of dominoes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomb:</strong> Creates a massive explosion, blasting surrounding dominoes away in a satisfying shockwave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rocket:</strong> Launches forward, crashing through anything in its path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firework:</strong> Shoots into the sky and explodes into beautiful colors, sending physical shockwaves down to the ground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Firefly:</strong> Emits a glowing light, creating a breathtaking and magical atmosphere in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/5e6e364c2fc4bfd806b87e48f6325610.poster.avif?t=1775718234\" width=800 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/5e6e364c2fc4bfd806b87e48f6325610.webm?t=1775718234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/5e6e364c2fc4bfd806b87e48f6325610.mp4?t=1775718234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Image-to-Domino Art:</strong> A groundbreaking procedural feature! Simply upload your favorite images (.png, .jpg), and the game will automatically convert the colored pixels into stunning domino floor art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/dd1e4a22abc65a5a18c40e5313a96f10.poster.avif?t=1775718234\" width=800 height=588 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/dd1e4a22abc65a5a18c40e5313a96f10.webm?t=1775718234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351830/extras/dd1e4a22abc65a5a18c40e5313a96f10.mp4?t=1775718234\" type=\"video/mp4\